  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第二关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_lmstreet_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呀吼~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "注意看路啦，能天使姐，不要單手扶握把！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "總算跟上你們了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "德克薩斯......下一次......請慢一點......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抱、抱歉。我已經儘量控制了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "既然咱們已經會合，那麼下一步就是去找老闆啦——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "慢著，我怎麼覺得少了點什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......拜松呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸？不應該是你們帶著他走嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......難道我們把他丟在那兒了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......習慣了我們自己的節奏，突然多出來一個人，是會把他忘掉啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——那我們是不是得趕緊回去幫忙？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不是有莫斯提馬在嗎？問題不大吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂——！等，等我一下！咳！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......自行車？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔噢！靠自行車就能追上德克薩斯的速度，拜松他挺行的嘛！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑幫",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂！他往哪個巷子去了！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑幫",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那個方向！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他身後還跟著一大批人喔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你不能奢求一個人騎著自行車還能甩開一整支武裝黑手黨。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......不對，有埋伏，能天使！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但好像有點來不及了喔——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "總、總算追上他們了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比諾",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是啊，辛苦你帶路了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "誰——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比諾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_028",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "睡一小會吧，小少爺。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘖，慢了一步。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比諾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_028",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "晚上好，企鵝物流的各位，我是甘比諾·里奇，家族的首領。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比諾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_028",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很遺憾，人質在我們手上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比諾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_028",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過，你們也不是會因為這點小事就亂了手腳的人吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "本來就是我們把他忘了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "倒、倒也是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你想怎樣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比諾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_028",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哼......你們東躲西藏的，實在讓人厭煩。動靜鬧太大，對大家都不好，不是嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比諾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_028",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這個小少爺的確還有點用處。有了人質，你們就只能正面應戰，別無選擇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比諾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_028",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這樣能為我省掉不少麻煩，能動手解決的問題，都是最好解決的問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比諾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_028",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "企鵝物流，你們現在無處可逃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "原來如此。那可真是太好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比諾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_028",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "畢竟我們也是這麼想的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可頌和空維持陣型。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "能天使注意掩護。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "搶回拜松。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
